&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are focused on and committed to helping people. You are a customer fanatic with a proven track record of going above and beyond for your customers. You treat others with care and empathy, and assume the best intentions in others. You are a great communicator, being able to simplify complex concepts into clear, easy-to-understand terms. You love to solve problems and figure out how and why things work. You are an analytical, motivated self-starter who thrives in a fast-paced start-up environment. You have the willingness to lean into a challenge and affect change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits Support team at Justworks is dedicated to helping our customers run their business with confidence. We are the benefits experts our customers rely on, and we help our customers manage their benefits and perks with ease. Our team takes ownership of our customer’s benefits concerns, and we actively drive issues to resolution. In this role you will support our small business customers with inquiries related to benefits and wellness perks , and contribute to internal discussions regarding product enhancements. We believe a positive team is the strongest unit, and we strive to make ourselves and each other better. This is a fast-paced and challenging role, but also incredibly rewarding due to the positive impact we have on our customers and their businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A variety of shifts and hours are available, and we will work with you to find the best fit.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Success Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of customer benefits issues from start to finish, in areas including but not limited to Medical, Dental, Vision, Retirement, Life Insurance, Disability Insurance, HSA and FSA, Commuter benefits, and other wellness perks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build mental muscle and become a benefits subject matter expert in the benefits tools within Justworks - you&#39;ll be a go to resource for both customers and coworkers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Answer inquiries on phone, tickets, and chat to help our customers optimize Justworks to administer group health and welfare plans and other benefits and perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work through creative solutions to effectively answer customer questions, provide guidance, troubleshoot and resolve issues by utilizing plan documents and business rules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a queue of open issues to deliver timely and effective solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Display a high level of professionalism and compassion when working with each customer on sensitive matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage chat functionality to help our customers optimize Justworks&amp;nbsp; to administer group health and welfare plans, including, but not limited to, Health, Life, Dental, Vision, Health Savings Accounts, Flexible Spending Accounts, Leaves Administration, Disability Insurance, and Commuter Benefits. Ensures benefit plans are within the guidelines of Section 125, COBRA, HIPAA, FMLA, and any city, state, and federal laws&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate customers in regards to policies, benefit eligibility, and employee rights and responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interact with cross-functional teams to identify areas where we can better serve our customers through product enhancement or process improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other related duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Will Do Your Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Customer Support Specialist, Benefits,, &lt;em&gt;how&lt;/em&gt; results are achieved is paramount for your success and ultimately result in our success as an organization. In this role, your foundational knowledge, skills, abilities and personal attributes are anchored in the following competencies:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative &lt;/strong&gt;- takes an approach that focuses on building relationships with others, understanding their problems, and developing solutions to their challenges through open-ended questions and active listening.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Taking responsibility &lt;/strong&gt;- being accountable, being committed, and accepting ownership for one&#39;s decisions, actions, and behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability &lt;/strong&gt;- the ability to adjust your approach or actions in response to changes in your external environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution-oriented &lt;/strong&gt;- identifies the source of a question or challenge and provides the right, or a better, way of doing things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious &lt;/strong&gt;- the innate desire to learn, grow and understand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, all Justworkers focus on aligning their behaviors to our core values known as COGIS. It stands for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Camaraderie&lt;/strong&gt; - Day to day you can be seen working together toward a higher purpose. You like to have fun. You’re an active listener, treat people respectfully, and have a strong desire to know and help others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Openness&lt;/strong&gt; - Your default is to be open. You&#39;re willing to share information, understand other perspectives, and consider new possibilities. You’re curious, ask open questions, and are receptive to thoughts and feedback from others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grit &lt;/strong&gt;- You demonstrate grit by having the courage to commit and persevere. You’re committed, earnest, and dive in to get the job done well with a positive attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrity&lt;/strong&gt; - Simply put, do what you say and say what you&#39;ll do. You’re honest and forthright, have a strong moral compass, and strive to match your words with your actions while leading by example.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; - Be like Einstein: “Everything should be made as simple as possible, but no simpler.”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of work experience in a customer/client-facing role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 year of experience working with benefits concepts and practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of operating in a time-sensitive or deadline-driven environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and an aptitude for learning new things and understanding how and why things work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to break down complex concepts into simple terms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent at time management, organization, and prioritizing tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Zendesk, JIRA, Talkdesk or related tools&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(Certified Employee Benefits Specialist (CEBS)? Or also &lt;a href=&quot;https://worldatwork.org/certification/certified-benefits-professionals-cbp?gclid=Cj0KCQjw3v6SBhCsARIsACyrRAlwWW4fdQQN-qeCc_3jpBXm8sTihqZKrQ8Ler6QgcG994O67zdy_wkaAriqEALw_wcB&quot;&gt;CBP&lt;/a&gt; (certified benefits professional)?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spanish language capability, or other second language at business conversation level, a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The base wage range for this position based in our New York City Office is targeted at $32.21 to $39.18 per hour.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid #LI-KC2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Actual compensation is based on multiple factors that are unique to each candidate, including and not limited to skill set, level of relevant experience, and specific work location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Salary ranges for positions based in other locations may differ based on the cost of labor in that location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more information about Justworks’ Total Reward Philosophy, including all of the perks and benefits we are proud to offer our team members, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#total-reward-philosophy&quot;&gt;Total Rewards @ Justworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity At Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Justworks is committed to maintaining a workplace where diversity of identity, culture, and life experience is the norm and is celebrated authentically and respected consistently. Diversity in our work, our people, and our product drives creativity and innovation, entrepreneurial leadership and integrity, competitiveness, and collaboration throughout our business and in the market. We depend on our differences to make our team stronger, our workplace more dynamic, and our product accessible to all of our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer open to all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or familial status, disability, pregnancy, gender identity or expression, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status. Justworks is fully dedicated to providing necessary support to candidates with disabilities who may require reasonable accommodations. We also provide reasonable accommodations to employees based on their sincerely held religious beliefs, as well as for other covered reasons consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws. If you&#39;re in need of a reasonable accommodation, please reach out to us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@justworks.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your comfort and success matter to us, and we&#39;re here to ensure an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/press/company-news/justworks-impact-report-2024&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our DEIB Report&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Justworks, we help small businesses confidently navigate the complexities of running a business—from payroll and benefits to HR, compliance, and workforce management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More small business owners are beginning their Justworks journey digitally. Many can evaluate and purchase Justworks through Self-Service. Others reach a point where having a knowledgeable person available can make the difference between getting stuck and confidently moving forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That’s where Digital Sales comes in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Digital Sales Advisor&lt;/strong&gt;, you will work with small business owners and administrators who are already engaging with Justworks digitally and where human guidance can help them take the next step.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional lead qualification role, and you won’t spend your day collecting information so someone else can sell to the customer. It also isn’t an order-taking role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will quickly understand what the customer is trying to accomplish, determine what is preventing them from moving forward, and take action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sometimes that means answering a benefits or payroll question and helping the customer continue through Self-Service. Sometimes it means helping them compare options, configure the right Justworks solution, and owning the sale through close. And sometimes it means recognizing that the customer’s needs require deeper expertise and making a seamless transition to Managed Sales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your job is simple: &lt;strong&gt;make it easier for small businesses to confidently choose and buy Justworks.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Success Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with small business owners and administrators who have demonstrated interest or intent through the Justworks digital buying experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer and behavioral signals to prioritize where your time and expertise can have the greatest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly understand customer readiness, needs, urgency, and complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct focused discovery that gets to the customer’s real question without unnecessarily extending the sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise customers across common payroll, benefits, HR, compliance, and workforce questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers understand which Justworks products best fit their needs and identify opportunities to sell the broader platform where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explain pricing and value clearly and confidently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the alternatives customers are considering and position Justworks effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle objections and confidently ask for the business when the customer is ready to buy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside customers to complete important steps rather than simply giving them another list of things to do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own appropriate opportunities through conversion and create a smooth transition into onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve discrete questions or blockers and help customers continue through Self-Service when that is the best experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognize when customer complexity warrants Managed Sales and make a seamless, context-rich transition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognize when a customer has genuine future potential but isn’t ready to buy today and move them into the appropriate nurture experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI and automation to prepare for conversations, understand customer context, complete follow-up, and minimize administrative work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture clean customer signals and outcomes so we can continuously improve how customers buy Justworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share recurring customer questions, objections, and friction with the teams improving our digital and Self-Service experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in experiments around customer signals, timing, messaging, sales plays, and workflows—and help us understand what actually improves customer and commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Will Do Your Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be consultative and commercial.&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t read a script or run every customer through the same discovery process. You listen, diagnose, advise, and sell.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create momentum.&lt;/strong&gt; Every customer interaction should move the buying journey forward with a clear outcome and next step.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use judgment.&lt;/strong&gt; You know when to sell, when to solve the immediate problem, when to bring in deeper expertise, and when a customer simply isn’t ready yet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do the work with the customer.&lt;/strong&gt; If helping a customer work through a quote, understand a contribution model, complete an application, or navigate another step gets them unstuck, you lean in and help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn broadly.&lt;/strong&gt; Small business owners don’t organize their questions around our internal teams. You develop enough knowledge across Justworks’ products to understand the problem, answer common questions, and get customers to the right outcome quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embrace technology.&lt;/strong&gt; AI and automation are core to how this team operates. You use them to eliminate administrative work and spend more time helping customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experiment and improve.&lt;/strong&gt; Digital Sales is a new motion. You will help us test and improve how we engage customers, and some of the work you do today may eventually become automated or built directly into the product. That’s success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a quota-carrying sales or other customer-facing commercial role; experience in high-velocity SMB, inbound, digital, or product-led sales is especially relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to understand customer needs and translate them into a clear recommendation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and comfort advising small business owners and decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial instinct—you recognize buying signals, can handle objections, and are comfortable asking for the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to learn products quickly and explain complex concepts simply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bias toward action and a willingness to work alongside customers to solve problems and keep them moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organization and follow-through in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using CRM systems, customer data, AI, and automation as part of your daily workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, adaptable, and energized by helping build something new.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with payroll, benefits, HR, PEO, fintech, SaaS, or SMB customers is helpful but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to work from our Phoenix office as part of an in-person team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid #LI-KH1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Actual compensation is based on multiple factors that are unique to each candidate, including and not limited to skill set, level of relevant experience, and specific work location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Salary ranges for positions based in other locations may differ based on the cost of labor in that location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more information about Justworks’ Total Reward Philosophy, including all of the perks and benefits we are proud to offer our team members, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#total-reward-philosophy&quot;&gt;Total Rewards @ Justworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity At Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Justworks is committed to maintaining a workplace where diversity of identity, culture, and life experience is the norm and is celebrated authentically and respected consistently. Diversity in our work, our people, and our product drives creativity and innovation, entrepreneurial leadership and integrity, competitiveness, and collaboration throughout our business and in the market. We depend on our differences to make our team stronger, our workplace more dynamic, and our product accessible to all of our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer open to all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or familial status, disability, pregnancy, gender identity or expression, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status. Justworks is fully dedicated to providing necessary support to candidates with disabilities who may require reasonable accommodations. We also provide reasonable accommodations to employees based on their sincerely held religious beliefs, as well as for other covered reasons consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws. If you&#39;re in need of a reasonable accommodation, please reach out to us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@justworks.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your comfort and success matter to us, and we&#39;re here to ensure an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/press/company-news/justworks-impact-report-2024&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our DEIB Report&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Director of Onboarding, you will be a vital part of the leadership team for Justworks’ broader Customer Success Organization. In this role, you will lead Justworks’ Customer Onboarding function, responsible for customers transitioning from the Sales team (acquisition) to being live on Justworks platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will oversee a 40+ person organization ensuring new customers to Justworks are properly set up to use the Justworks solution. Beyond getting a customer live and compliantly on the platform, your team is focused on adoption and optimization of our products, including add-on services and marketplace integrations. You will be responsible for ensuring high-quality customer service, effective onboarding, and commercial revenue expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring experience in driving customer onboarding journey optimization—bringing together operational rigor, technical expertise, and seamless delivery. You will foster a best-in-class onboarding organization through partnership with key stakeholders, including our customers, to ensure viable and value-adding services to the business. You will focus on driving success through mentoring and planning for a team of Onboarding Managers and the frontline managers overseeing them. You will report directly to the Senior Director of Customer Success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position plays a key role in driving success for our customers while simultaneously increasing revenue to the business. In order to be successful, the Director will need to be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic business leader- you strike the right balance of ensuring exceptional customer experiences, managing to key performance indicators including retention and growth, and setting the strategic vision for Onboarding as Justworks grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exemplary people manager- you invest in your people, and are always thinking about how to develop their skills, provide them with new experiences, and grow their knowledge about partnering and managing customers in our complex and ever changing industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A problem solver- you genuinely enjoy figuring out how and why things work, and looks to optimize for the customers and scale for Justworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive relationship builder- you partner with key stakeholders, including our customers and internal, cross-functional partners, to ensure the growth of the business and that the Customer Success team is best-in-class.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Success Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Work On&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, expand and mentor the Customer Onboarding team by setting the strategy, prioritizing Objectives and Key Results (OKRs), as well as hiring, training and developing a world-class team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive customer lifetime value by optimizing the customer onboarding journey, delivering promised value through exceptional operational and technical experience design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy programs to drive early adoption and business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-create and execute a multi-faceted onboarding journey strategy in partnership with the Director of Growth &amp;amp; Retention, Product, and&amp;nbsp; Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross functionally with peers across the company to collaborate and ensure that your team has what they need to be successful.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the voice of the customer and influence internal stakeholders by promoting a customer-centric mindset across the organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Sales and Revenue leadership to identify expansion opportunities during onboarding, driving early adoption of add-on services and marketplace integrations to maximize platform optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Display a high level of professionalism and compassion when working with employees and customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other duties, as needed, based on department and/or organizational needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Will Do Your Work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
