&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;T&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;aking responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;- Being accountable, being committed, and accepting ownership for one&#39;s decisions, actions, and behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
