&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grit&lt;/strong&gt;-&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;You demonstrate grit by having the courage to commit and persevere. You’re committed, earnest, and dive in to get the job done well with a positive attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrity&lt;/strong&gt;-&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Simply put, do what you say and say what you&#39;ll do. You’re honest and forthright, have a strong moral compass, and strive to match your words with your actions while leading by example.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
