&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 10 years of professional experience, ideally in onboarding, implementation, customer success, account management, account development, customer support, professional services or related fields&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 6 years of people management experience building and managing large (ideally 40+ employees) customer-facing teams in a fast-paced, dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a management team of managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of building, executing, and hitting adoption and revenue expansion plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with complex products and communicating complicated ideas and processes in an easy to understand way&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to architect onboarding and implementation delivery models that align with current customer segments, deliver customer value and scale with growth projections&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable advocating for customers with the ability and willingness to engage directly with customers&lt;/li&gt;
