&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 10 years of professional experience, ideally in customer success, account management, account development, customer support, professional services or related fields&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 6 years of people management experience building and managing large (60+ employees) customer-facing teams in a fast-paced, dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
