&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and implementing learning and development programs or similar enablement efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills; able to juggle multiple priorities and projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills; comfort facilitating groups and representing work to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
