&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience as a software engineer working on production web applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 1 years of engineering management experience in the industry, with a proven track role in building and growing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong technical leader comfortable with a 50/50 split between people management and hands-on technical guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience leveraging AI technologies to build modern features and optimize system maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional cross-functional communication skills, with the ability to lead and collaborate effectively across both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High levels of empathy and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core experience with &lt;strong&gt;Go&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Microservices&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Event-Driven Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core Web technologies: i.e. Data structures, data stores, algorithms, distributed systems and common patterns around these frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies Used&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Golang, Ruby on Rails, Javascript, MySQL, Kafka, AWS, Git, Memcache, Redis, ElasticSearch, Docker, Terraform, Kubernetes, CircleCI, DataDog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
