&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the functional owner for Workday Payroll, Absence, and Time Tracking: configuration, maintenance, and day-to-day support across all three&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional PATT projects from requirements gathering through design, testing, deployment, and post-launch support, translating business needs into technical solutions and flagging process flaws or alternative approaches along the way&lt;/li&gt;
