&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Internal Audit at Justworks is a well-established function and there is significant potential for professional growth. As a Senior Internal Auditor, you will be representing Internal Audit and actively partnering with business and risk stakeholders to assess and recommend updates to financial, operational and technology risks across the organization. This role presents a significant opportunity to: (i) execute financial, operational, technology audits and special projects, (ii) offer solutions for complex business issues, (iii) interact with various levels of management, and (iv) be a strategic management advisor. Key projects will include a combination of audit and management advisory work along with SOX initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Success Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and perform integrated financial/operational/technology audits, and special projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support audit planning and Enterprise Risk Management initiatives in accordance with IIA standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate risks, perform control assessments, report results, and make recommendations to improve internal controls over business processes, systems and financial reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track audit reporting and issue resolution to ensure that agreed-upon actions are completed adequately by the appropriate stakeholders within the specified timeframes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with the external auditors to support the delivery of SOC and financial audits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to process improvement initiatives, including establishment of continuous monitoring models across key business and IT processes and performance metric reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data analytics and Generative/Agentic AI tools (e.g., Gemini, ChatGPT, Copilot) to enhance audit coverage, improve testing efficiency, and identify potential risk indicators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interact with senior and line-level management in matters relating to internal controls and enterprise risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the design and delivery of risk and control awareness training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Will Do Your Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Internal Auditor, &lt;em&gt;how&lt;/em&gt; results are achieved is paramount for your success and ultimately results in our success as an organization. In this role, your foundational knowledge, skills, abilities, and personal attributes are anchored in the following competencies:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communication -&lt;/strong&gt; the ability to articulate thoughts and express ideas effectively using oral, written, visual and non-verbal communication skills, as well as listening skills to gain understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ethical practice - &lt;/strong&gt;the ability to integrate core values, integrity, and accountability throughout all organizational and business practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detail-oriented - &lt;/strong&gt;exercises extreme attention to detail; is thorough, accurate, organized, and productive and seeks to understand both the cause and effect of a situation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk assessment - &lt;/strong&gt;applying a logical step-by-step process to protect, and consequently minimize risks to, the organization, interests, and employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manages complexity - &lt;/strong&gt;making sense of complex, high quantity, and sometimes contradictory information to effectively solve problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, all Justworkers focus on aligning their behaviors to our core values known as COGIS. It stands for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Camaraderie&lt;/strong&gt; - Day to day, you can be seen working together toward a higher purpose. You like to have fun. You’re an active listener, treat people respectfully, and have a strong desire to know and help others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Openness&lt;/strong&gt; - Your default is to be open. You&#39;re willing to share information, understand other perspectives, and consider new possibilities. You’re curious, ask open questions, and are receptive to thoughts and feedback from others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grit &lt;/strong&gt;- You demonstrate grit by having the courage to commit and persevere. You’re committed, earnest, and dive in to get the job done well with a positive attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrity&lt;/strong&gt; - Simply put, do what you say and say what you&#39;ll do. You’re honest and forthright, have a strong moral compass, and strive to match your words with your actions while leading by example.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; - Think like Einstein: “Everything should be made as simple as possible, but no simpler.”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of at least 3-5 years of experience in internal audit, public accounting, finance, consulting, or information systems audit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s/Master’s degree in accounting, finance, or a related field required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to financial, operational, SOX, SOC audits and technology audits covering IT general controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level and process risks, control procedures, frameworks (COSO/COBIT), methodologies, agile audit, and other leading audit techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-versed in project management and a demonstrated ability to flex between being an independent contributor and a collaborative team member based on project needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective written and verbal communication skills, and be comfortable dealing with ambiguity, problem solving and conflict management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CIA/CPA/CISA preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at HR, Tech, SAAS companies would be useful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to process design, process improvement and/or Six Sigma techniques would be useful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Generative and Agentic AI tools (e.g., Gemini, ChatGPT, Claude) to execute audit workflows, enhance continuous monitoring, and streamline documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with evaluating AI-integrated systems, understanding AI governance, and assessing related controls in alignment with emerging frameworks (e.g., NIST AI RMF, ISO/IEC 42001).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The base wage range for this position based in our New York City Office is targeted at $109,000.00 to $136,000.00 per year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot; data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid #LI-CD1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Actual compensation is based on multiple factors that are unique to each candidate, including and not limited to skill set, level of relevant experience, and specific work location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Salary ranges for positions based in other locations may differ based on the cost of labor in that location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more information about Justworks’ Total Reward Philosophy, including all of the perks and benefits we are proud to offer our team members, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#total-reward-philosophy&quot;&gt;Total Rewards @ Justworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity At Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Justworks is committed to maintaining a workplace where diversity of identity, culture, and life experience is the norm and is celebrated authentically and respected consistently. Diversity in our work, our people, and our product drives creativity and innovation, entrepreneurial leadership and integrity, competitiveness, and collaboration throughout our business and in the market. We depend on our differences to make our team stronger, our workplace more dynamic, and our product accessible to all of our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer open to all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or familial status, disability, pregnancy, gender identity or expression, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status. Justworks is fully dedicated to providing necessary support to candidates with disabilities who may require reasonable accommodations. We also provide reasonable accommodations to employees based on their sincerely held religious beliefs, as well as for other covered reasons consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws. If you&#39;re in need of a reasonable accommodation, please reach out to us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@justworks.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your comfort and success matter to us, and we&#39;re here to ensure an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/press/company-news/justworks-impact-report-2024&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our DEIB Report&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Data &amp;amp; Analytics team is Justworks&#39; data center of excellence — a connected set of functions spanning analytics, data science, analytics engineering, data governance, and platform data/ML engineering. You&#39;ll find a highly collaborative group motivated by craft, shared learning, and a genuine commitment to growing our impact for customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advanced Analytics is our decision intelligence team, helping leaders make the company&#39;s biggest bets: where to invest, what to charge, and what plan to commit to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are an experienced analytics leader with a rigorous mindset and a strong eye for how decisions get made. You work on the decisions that shape the business: How should we split next year&#39;s marketing budget? What should we charge for a new product? Which customers are worth the most to acquire and keep? What plan should we commit to?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role owns the models behind those decisions. You choose the right method for each question, build it with your team, and stand behind the recommendation when leaders act on it. You&#39;re comfortable with imperfect data and with problems where a clean experiment isn&#39;t possible. You can explain forecasts, experiments, and models to both technical and non-technical audiences, and you are clear about the tradeoffs and uncertainty in every call.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Senior Director, Enterprise Analytics, you&#39;ll build and lead a team of data scientists focused on advanced analytics for Finance, Marketing, and Product Marketing. Work will include pricing analysis, forecasting, MMM, etc. We have done this work for years, however this is a new team built to give it dedicated focus, depth, and a long-term roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead a team of data scientists through hiring, professional development, goal-setting, feedback, and recognition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement a roadmap for Advanced Analytics aligned with Justworks strategic priorities and the decisions Finance, Marketing, and Product Marketing need to make&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear standards for when a decision calls for a quick analysis, an experiment, or a model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Decision Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial and business modeling&lt;/strong&gt; - revenue, churn, and lifetime value models that shape annual plans, targets, and investment choices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing mix modeling&lt;/strong&gt; - guide how marketing budget is allocated across channels, including offline and out-of-home&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pricing and monetization&lt;/strong&gt; - pricing research such as conjoint analysis and willingness to pay, to inform what we charge and how we package it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Causal inference and incrementality&lt;/strong&gt; - establish what actually drives results using experiments, holdouts, geo tests, and quasi-experimental methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnership &amp;amp; Standards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business leaders to go beyond the initial request, frame the decision, and design the right technical approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the methods behind the team&#39;s models, and partner with Data Governance and Analytics Engineering so those models are built on trusted data that executives can rely on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the standard for AI-assisted analytics, including where AI tools are used, where human review is required, and how analysis and model outputs are validated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other related responsibilities as needed based on department and/or organizational needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Will Do Your Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the Senior Manager, Advanced Analytics, &lt;em&gt;how&lt;/em&gt; results are achieved is paramount for your success and ultimately result in our success as an organization. In this role, your foundational knowledge, skills, abilities and personal attributes are anchored in the following competencies:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plans &amp;amp; Aligns&lt;/strong&gt; - Ensures individual actions support company mission; communicates effectively; understands urgency and plans accordingly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balances Stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt; - Understands internal and external stakeholder requirements, expectations, and needs and acts fairly despite conflicting demands of stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence and Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; - Fosters a community of knowledge-sharing, collaboration, mentorship, and forward-thinking across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manages Complexity&lt;/strong&gt; - Makes sense of complex, high quantity, and sometimes contradictory information to effectively solve problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good Judgment&lt;/strong&gt; - Pauses before acting; asks questions to fully understand context; applies critical thinking and takes ownership of outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt; - Honors diverse thoughts and opinions; leverages unique skills to maximize efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt; - Capacity to actively learn and apply specific domain knowledge, know-how, and best practices to continually enhance and improve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, all Justworkers focus on aligning their behaviors to our core values known as COGIS. It stands for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Camaraderie&lt;/strong&gt; - Day to day you can be seen working together toward a higher purpose. You like to have fun. You’re an active listener, treat people respectfully, and have a strong desire to know and help others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Openness&lt;/strong&gt; - Your default is to be open. You&#39;re willing to share information, understand other perspectives, and consider new possibilities. You’re curious, ask open questions, and are receptive to thoughts and feedback from others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grit &lt;/strong&gt;- You demonstrate grit by having the courage to commit and persevere. You’re committed, earnest, and dive in to get the job done well with a positive attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrity&lt;/strong&gt; - Simply put, do what you say and say what you&#39;ll do. You’re honest and forthright, have a strong moral compass, and strive to match your words with your actions while leading by example.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; - Be like Einstein: “Everything should be made as simple as possible, but no simpler.”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in data science or advanced analytics, with depth in at least two of: forecasting and LTV, marketing mix modeling, pricing research, or causal inference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in people management, with a proven track record of developing and managing high-performing data science or analytics teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Python for statistical analysis and modeling, working SQL, and fluency in experimentation and causal inference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong statistical foundation: regression, time-series forecasting, Bayesian methods, and quasi-experimental design (e.g., difference-in-differences, synthetic control)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building and defending models that inform decisions — a budget, a price, a plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent oral and written communication, with a track record of turning complex analysis into clear recommendations that drive executive decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with VP-level and above stakeholders, reframing and scoping their asks rather than only delivering what is requested&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively uses AI in analytical work, with a clear point of view on where it helps, where it fails, and how its output should be checked&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Statistics, Economics, Mathematics, or a related quantitative field, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The base wage range for this position based in our New York City Office is targeted at &lt;span class=&quot;collapsed-field-text&quot;&gt;$240,000.00 - $310,000.00&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;per year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-DG2 #LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Actual compensation is based on multiple factors that are unique to each candidate, including and not limited to skill set, level of relevant experience, and specific work location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Salary ranges for positions based in other locations may differ based on the cost of labor in that location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more information about Justworks’ Total Reward Philosophy, including all of the perks and benefits we are proud to offer our team members, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#total-reward-philosophy&quot;&gt;Total Rewards @ Justworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity At Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Justworks is committed to maintaining a workplace where diversity of identity, culture, and life experience is the norm and is celebrated authentically and respected consistently. Diversity in our work, our people, and our product drives creativity and innovation, entrepreneurial leadership and integrity, competitiveness, and collaboration throughout our business and in the market. We depend on our differences to make our team stronger, our workplace more dynamic, and our product accessible to all of our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer open to all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or familial status, disability, pregnancy, gender identity or expression, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status. Justworks is fully dedicated to providing necessary support to candidates with disabilities who may require reasonable accommodations. We also provide reasonable accommodations to employees based on their sincerely held religious beliefs, as well as for other covered reasons consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws. If you&#39;re in need of a reasonable accommodation, please reach out to us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@justworks.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your comfort and success matter to us, and we&#39;re here to ensure an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/press/company-news/justworks-impact-report-2024&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our DEIB Report&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Justworkers are already using AI to solve problems, build applications, and automate their work. They know their challenges best, and we&#39;re building an AI Enablement team to give them the tools, engineering expertise, and support to turn their ideas into reliable, secure, production-ready solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our Senior Manager, AI Enablement, you&#39;ll lead a new team focused on making AI-powered development and automation more accessible across Justworks. You&#39;ll start with one senior engineer, help hire another, and build a collaborative environment where both can grow, learn from each other, and do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together, your team will own our core employee AI platform, develop purpose-built AI agents and automation, and establish the engineering foundations that help Justworkers build and deploy applications independently. You&#39;ll bring together expertise in applied AI, enterprise systems, and software engineering to deliver solutions that make a meaningful difference in how people work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a people-first leader who genuinely enjoys developing engineers and hasn&#39;t lost their curiosity for building things. Someone who can guide technical decisions, get hands-on when needed, and knows when to step back and let their team take ownership. You&#39;ll lead with trust, coaching, and thoughtful feedback while helping your engineers grow beyond their individual areas of expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a new function within IT Services, with a clear mission and plenty of room to shape how it operates. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to build a team, establish its culture and technical direction, and make a lasting impact on how Justworkers use technology to get things done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Lead and Develop the AI Enablement Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a team of senior engineers with complementary expertise in enterprise AI platforms, integrations, applied AI, and software engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the team&#39;s technical direction, priorities, engineering practices, and delivery processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain hands-on with solution architecture, development, debugging, and technical problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with stakeholders across Justworks to understand business needs, prioritize opportunities, and deliver solutions with measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a culture of technical ownership, collaboration, knowledge sharing, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Own and Evolve the Employee AI Platform&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the administration, integration, reliability, and ongoing evolution of Claude and Cowork as Justworks&#39; core employee AI platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the development of integrations, MCP servers, APIs, and automation that extend platform capabilities and connect AI to enterprise systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Security, Governance, and other technical teams to establish appropriate controls for data access, authentication, authorization, and responsible AI usage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging AI capabilities and determine where they can improve employee productivity or unlock new workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Build Agentic AI Solutions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design, development, deployment, and maintenance of AI agents and applications that solve real business problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build systems that go beyond conversational AI, enabling agents to interact with tools, execute workflows, and take actions across enterprise applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish engineering approaches for agent orchestration, tool calling, context management, error handling, evaluation, and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with business and technical partners to translate opportunities into practical, maintainable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance rapid experimentation with the security, reliability, and operational requirements of production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Enable Employee-Built Applications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help employees successfully develop, deploy, and maintain applications created using AI-assisted development tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership when employee-built applications encounter challenges involving dependencies, runtime environments, APIs, authentication, deployment, or application architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish reusable deployment patterns, templates, tooling, and CI/CD practices that reduce friction between local development and production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop engineering standards and guardrails that make secure, reliable application development easier for employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the team provides targeted engineering assistance without becoming the default owner or support team for every employee-built application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Drive Education, Adoption, and Continuous Improvement&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the development of office hours, workshops, documentation, and self-service resources that help employees build and operate solutions independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify recurring development and deployment challenges and turn them into reusable tools, guidance, or platform improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish meaningful measures of AI platform adoption, agent performance, deployment success, employee enablement, and business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use employee feedback and operational data to continuously improve the team&#39;s capabilities and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant professional experience in software engineering, applied AI, or platform engineering, with enough depth to architect systems, review code, and contribute directly to the team’s technical work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 4 years managing engineers directly, with full responsibility for hiring, performance, and career development. Tech lead experience alone is not a substitute.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated hands-on experience building and deploying AI-powered applications or agents using modern large language models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of agentic AI architectures, including tool calling, agent orchestration, APIs, and integrations with external systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python or another modern programming language, with the ability to review code, troubleshoot unfamiliar applications, and contribute directly to engineering solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and operating production applications, including deployment, dependency management, CI/CD, monitoring, and incident troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of software architecture, API design, authentication, authorization, and secure development practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud platforms, containerization, and modern application deployment patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance hands-on technical contributions with engineering leadership, prioritization, and team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills, particularly when working with employees and stakeholders who have varying levels of technical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical approach to AI: focused on solving real problems, improving workflows, and delivering sustainable solutions rather than adopting technology for its own sake.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Claude, Anthropic APIs, Model Context Protocol (MCP), or comparable AI platforms and integration frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with agent development frameworks such as LangGraph, Google ADK, or similar orchestration tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience establishing internal developer platforms, engineering enablement programs, or self-service development capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI-assisted software development tools and the challenges of moving generated applications into production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing evaluation frameworks, tracing, monitoring, and reliability controls for AI agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in regulated environments where security, privacy, and compliance are important considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling a new engineering team or technical function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first 6–12 months, you&#39;ll have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established a clear technical roadmap and operating model for the AI Enablement team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built a collaborative team where engineers share expertise and can contribute across the team&#39;s responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved the reliability, capabilities, and accessibility of Justworks&#39; employee AI platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivered production-ready AI agents or automation that solve meaningful business problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introduced reusable engineering tools and deployment standards that help employees successfully move applications into production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established education and self-service resources that reduce recurring technical barriers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developed visibility into AI adoption, employee-built applications, recurring engineering challenges, and the impact of the team&#39;s work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, success means more Justworkers can confidently build and ship reliable applications, whether they&#39;re powered by AI or built with AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The base wage range for this position based in our New York City Office is targeted at $188,000.00 - $269,000.00 per year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI Tools.&lt;/strong&gt; We may use artificial intelligence and other automated tools to process your personal information as part of the recruitment process. For example, we may use these tools to record, transcribe, and summarize interviews, to help organize and review applications, and to help us assess candidates by comparing their skills, experience, and qualifications against the criteria for open roles. These tools support, but do not replace, human review. We do not make hiring decisions based solely on automated processing, and all final hiring decisions are made by Justworks recruiters and hiring managers. Depending on where you reside, you may have rights regarding our use of automated tools. For more information, please contact us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:privacy@justworks.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid #LI-RG1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Actual compensation is based on multiple factors that are unique to each candidate, including and not limited to skill set, level of relevant experience, and specific work location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Salary ranges for positions based in other locations may differ based on the cost of labor in that location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more information about Justworks’ Total Reward Philosophy, including all of the perks and benefits we are proud to offer our team members, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#total-reward-philosophy&quot;&gt;Total Rewards @ Justworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity At Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Justworks is committed to maintaining a workplace where diversity of identity, culture, and life experience is the norm and is celebrated authentically and respected consistently. Diversity in our work, our people, and our product drives creativity and innovation, entrepreneurial leadership and integrity, competitiveness, and collaboration throughout our business and in the market. We depend on our differences to make our team stronger, our workplace more dynamic, and our product accessible to all of our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer open to all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or familial status, disability, pregnancy, gender identity or expression, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status. Justworks is fully dedicated to providing necessary support to candidates with disabilities who may require reasonable accommodations. We also provide reasonable accommodations to employees based on their sincerely held religious beliefs, as well as for other covered reasons consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws. If you&#39;re in need of a reasonable accommodation, please reach out to us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@justworks.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your comfort and success matter to us, and we&#39;re here to ensure an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/press/company-news/justworks-impact-report-2024&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our DEIB Report&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data &amp;amp; Analytics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a data leader who understands that trustworthy analytics doesn’t happen by accident — it has to be built, maintained, and governed. You think in programs, not tickets. You’re energized by the challenge of setting standards that actually stick, and you know that getting adoption requires credibility, relationship-building, and a genuine understanding of what teams need from their data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re as comfortable writing SQL and reviewing dbt models as you are facilitating a stakeholder alignment meeting or coaching an IC through ambiguity. You see AI tooling not as a novelty but as a practical lever for scaling work that would otherwise be prohibitively manual, and you’re already using it that way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly skilled and motivated &lt;strong&gt;Senior&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Manager, Data Governance&lt;/strong&gt; to lead Justworks’ nascent Data Governance team. This is a &lt;em&gt;player-coach role&lt;/em&gt;: you will manage a growing team of ICs while owning the programs, standards, and cross-functional relationships that make self-serve analytics at Justworks actually work. Your team’s mandate is to set and enforce the conditions under which analytics assets are defined, certified, documented, and trusted before they reach the business. This work is initiative-driven rather than request-response, and it requires someone who can prioritize without a defined ticket queue, build standards that engineers and analysts will adopt, and make the case for governance to stakeholders who may not have asked for it yet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Success Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop the Data Governance team&lt;/strong&gt; — currently two ICs (a Senior Analytics Engineer and a Data Governance Analyst), with further growth anticipated this year — through clear priorities, coaching, and recognition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the foundational governance buildout&lt;/strong&gt;: metadata standards and taxonomy, business domain framework, glossary migration and enrichment, data profiling governance, and model conformance for silver- and gold-layer assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the ongoing governance programs&lt;/strong&gt;: asset certification and re-certification, data quality observability, glossary and metrics-catalog freshness, standards enforcement and audit, new asset intake and review, and stakeholder education and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the data catalog (Atlan)&lt;/strong&gt; — ensuring the continued accuracy, completeness, and hygiene of asset metadata, glossary terms, and data products; and driving adoption of Atlan as the primary way stakeholders engage with certified data across Justworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set and enforce certification standards&lt;/strong&gt;: Governance holds the right to withhold or revoke certification on assets that fail to meet the standard. You’ll exercise that authority credibly and collaboratively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Serve as a key subject matter expert for Data &amp;amp; Analytics and cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;: arbitrate metric and definition differences, and drive company-wide adoption of best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive an AI-native way of working and thinking&lt;/strong&gt;: accelerate our data governance maturity by leveraging AI for unifying information, enriching metadata, automating governance work and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to the data governance strategy&lt;/strong&gt; and roadmap in partnership with Data &amp;amp; Analytics leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Will Do Your Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the Manager, Data Governance role, &lt;em&gt; how &lt;/em&gt; results are achieved is paramount for your success and ultimately results in our success as an organization. Your foundational knowledge, skills, abilities, and personal attributes are anchored in the following competencies:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plans &amp;amp; Aligns&lt;/strong&gt; — Translates governance strategy into a prioritized, executable roadmap; communicates clearly about progress, tradeoffs, and urgency; ensures the team’s work is always connected to measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balances Stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt; — Understands that governance works by earning trust, not mandating compliance. Develops standards in partnership with affected teams, acts fairly under conflicting demands, and maintains relationships even when decisions are hard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence and Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; — Builds credibility with engineers, analysts, and business stakeholders alike. Fosters a culture of knowledge-sharing, continuous improvement, and proactive thinking about data trust across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manages Complexity&lt;/strong&gt; — Navigates a work environment that blends technical depth, program ownership, and cross-functional coordination. Turns ambiguous mandates into concrete, actionable programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Displays good Judgment&lt;/strong&gt; — Knows when to enforce a standard and when to build consensus first. Asks questions before acting, applies critical thinking, and takes ownership of outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt; — Bridges technical and non-technical audiences. Translates governance concepts into business value, and business requirements into engineering standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt; — Maintains hands-on fluency in the technical stack (SQL, dbt, dimensional modeling) and actively develops expertise in evolving areas: AI tooling, data observability, and governance tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, all Justworkers focus on aligning their behaviors to our core values known as COGIS. It stands for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Camaraderie&lt;/strong&gt; — Day to day you can be seen working together toward a higher purpose. You like to have fun. You’re an active listener, treat people respectfully, and have a strong desire to know and help others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Openness&lt;/strong&gt; — Your default is to be open. You’re willing to share information, understand other perspectives, and consider new possibilities. You’re curious, ask open questions, and are receptive to thoughts and feedback from others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grit&lt;/strong&gt; — You demonstrate grit by having the courage to commit and persevere. You’re committed, earnest, and dive in to get the job done well with a positive attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrity&lt;/strong&gt; — Simply put, do what you say and say what you’ll do. You’re honest and forthright, have a strong moral compass, and strive to match your words with your actions while leading by example.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; — Be like Einstein: “Everything should be made as simple as possible, but no simpler.”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in a data role such as analytics engineering, data engineering, or data governance, with hands-on experience in SQL and dbt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in people management, with a demonstrated track record of developing ICs and managing team delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning data governance, data quality, or data standards programs — not just contributing to them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in SQL; working experience with dbt and dimensional modeling sufficient to define standards and review model conformance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience with managing data catalogs or data governance tooling (Atlan, Alation, Collibra, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on fluency with AI tooling as a productivity and automation lever; ability to apply it within the context of metadata management, documentation, and governance workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills; ability to drive alignment across technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong program ownership mindset: comfortable prioritizing proactively, operating without a defined ticket queue, and driving initiatives that span teams and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a startup or high-growth environment where programs had to be built from scratch is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The base wage range for this position based in our New York City Office is targeted at &lt;span class=&quot;collapsed-field-text&quot;&gt;$166,000.00 - $214,000.00&lt;/span&gt; per year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-DG2 #LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Actual compensation is based on multiple factors that are unique to each candidate, including and not limited to skill set, level of relevant experience, and specific work location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Salary ranges for positions based in other locations may differ based on the cost of labor in that location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more information about Justworks’ Total Reward Philosophy, including all of the perks and benefits we are proud to offer our team members, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#total-reward-philosophy&quot;&gt;Total Rewards @ Justworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity At Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Justworks is committed to maintaining a workplace where diversity of identity, culture, and life experience is the norm and is celebrated authentically and respected consistently. Diversity in our work, our people, and our product drives creativity and innovation, entrepreneurial leadership and integrity, competitiveness, and collaboration throughout our business and in the market. We depend on our differences to make our team stronger, our workplace more dynamic, and our product accessible to all of our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer open to all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or familial status, disability, pregnancy, gender identity or expression, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status. Justworks is fully dedicated to providing necessary support to candidates with disabilities who may require reasonable accommodations. We also provide reasonable accommodations to employees based on their sincerely held religious beliefs, as well as for other covered reasons consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws. If you&#39;re in need of a reasonable accommodation, please reach out to us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@justworks.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your comfort and success matter to us, and we&#39;re here to ensure an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/press/company-news/justworks-impact-report-2024&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our DEIB Report&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Justworks is rethinking how we drive growth across the entire prospect and customer journey. Our goal is to build an intelligent, AI-powered growth engine that helps us identify and engage prospective customers, convert demand more effectively, and support customers as their businesses grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Manager, Growth Automation &amp;amp; AI to lead the next evolution of our Marketing Operations capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines deep marketing expertise, a strong understanding of customer growth, and the technical vision to fundamentally change how work gets done. You&#39;ll lead a team of hands-on builder-operators responsible for demand operations, lifecycle orchestration, marketing activation, and campaign automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be accountable for ensuring Marketing has the systems, execution capabilities, and operational support it needs today while building the AI-powered workflows and intelligent customer journeys that will enable us to scale tomorrow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting within GTM Effectiveness, this role maintains a formal dotted-line relationship to Marketing leadership, with direct participation in Marketing planning and leadership forums and shared accountability for delivering Marketing&#39;s operational priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role. We&#39;re looking for someone who has built and deployed solutions, understands how modern marketing and growth systems work, and knows when to use AI, traditional automation, or human judgment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with leaders across Marketing, Sales, Product, Customer Success, Analytics, and GTM Engineering to turn business opportunities into scalable capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission is to build the systems that drive customer acquisition, engagement, and expansion across Justworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Responsible For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Lifecycle Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build the capabilities that help Justworks recognize customer needs, identify opportunities, and deliver the right experience at the right time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the evolution of demand operations, including enrichment, qualification, scoring, routing, segmentation, nurture, and re-engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design intelligent journeys across acquisition, digital shopping, sales-assisted conversion, onboarding, adoption, retention, and expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business strategies and customer signals into decisioning logic, triggers, personalized engagement, and next-best actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify gaps, friction, and inefficiencies across the prospect and customer journey and develop scalable solutions to address them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business owners to ensure intelligent engagement connects to clear commercial and customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing Activation &amp;amp; Operational Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the operational capabilities that allow Marketing to execute effectively and at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the accountable functional leader for Marketing Operations within the matrixed GTM Effectiveness organization, ensuring coherent strategy, prioritization, capability development, and delivery across the resources supporting Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee reliable campaign activation across paid media, web, email, events, nurture, and customer engagement programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable workflows, templates, and automation that reduce the time and manual effort required to launch and manage campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure effective audience management, campaign tracking, data capture, quality assurance, consent, and downstream follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Marketing&#39;s end-to-end functional architecture within the broader GTM architecture, connecting customer data, audience intelligence, activation platforms, lifecycle orchestration, campaign execution, and measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Marketing in company-wide GTM architecture decisions, partnering with GTM Engineering on shared infrastructure, technical standards, integrations, and implementation priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear intake, prioritization, capacity planning, and operating standards so Marketing has visibility into commitments and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Powered Growth Transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the shift from traditional marketing operations toward an intelligent, increasingly automated growth operating model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to redesign marketing and lifecycle workflows using AI agents, automation, and new approaches to execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design, prototyping, and implementation of AI-powered capabilities in partnership with GTM Engineering and builder-operators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Marketing&#39;s AI context layer, including the shared knowledge, customer context, and business rules that enable humans and agents to operate effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the functional requirements and adoption of reusable Marketing AI agents and workflows, leveraging shared GTM Engineering infrastructure wherever possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish Marketing-specific governance standards for agent permissions, human approvals, brand consistency, customer data usage, monitoring, and quality, aligned with broader GTM technical and security standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging technologies and recommend when to build, buy, or leverage existing platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve how the organization operates, increasing execution capacity without proportional increases in cost or complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing Intelligence &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure Marketing and GTM teams can understand performance, identify opportunities, and act on what they&#39;re learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with GTM Planning &amp;amp; Analytics to establish reliable data, tracking, and measurement across acquisition and lifecycle programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure marketing systems capture the information needed to understand customer behavior, campaign effectiveness, and journey progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve lead quality, conversion, engagement, and operational efficiency through better data and decisioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build automated monitoring and exception detection to identify broken journeys, missed follow-up, and execution issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear measures of the business impact, adoption, and operational leverage of AI and automation investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership &amp;amp; Team Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the Marketing Operations team, including hiring, coaching, performance management, and development of builder-operators with deep marketing domain expertise. Partner with Marketing leadership on talent selection, capability needs, and team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Marketing leadership to translate strategic priorities into an actionable capability roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Revenue Operations, Product, Customer Success, and Partnerships to connect customer journeys and operational workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with GTM Engineering to define requirements, prioritize shared technical resources, and bring new capabilities into production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear ownership, decision rights, and working agreements across functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring new ideas and emerging industry practices into Justworks, challenging existing approaches and building a culture of continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in growth operations, marketing operations, lifecycle marketing, revenue operations, or a related function, including experience leading teams or significant cross-functional initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of B2B marketing, demand generation, customer acquisition, lifecycle engagement, and marketing execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building and deploying AI-powered automation or intelligent workflows that are operating in production and delivering measurable business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of redesigning processes and operating models to improve growth, execution speed, quality, or efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical fluency across CRM, marketing automation, customer data, and workflow orchestration platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with modern data architectures, including cloud data warehouses, composable CDPs, reverse ETL, APIs, and SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AI and automation tools, including the ability to prototype solutions and work effectively with engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical judgment and experience translating performance insights into operational improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering across Marketing, Sales, Product, Engineering, Analytics, and other GTM functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership and communication skills, with the ability to align stakeholders, establish priorities, and turn complex problems into practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder&#39;s mindset: you are comfortable moving between strategy and execution, testing new approaches, and challenging how work has traditionally been done.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Especially Compelling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI agents, agentic workflows, and AI-assisted development tools such as Claude Code, Codex, or similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving conversion, lead quality, customer engagement, or acquisition efficiency through growth automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting a multi-product business with self-service, hybrid, and sales-assisted customer journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evolving a traditional Marketing Operations organization into a more technical, automated, and AI-native capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience balancing reliable day-to-day marketing delivery with longer-term technology and operating model transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing executes faster and more effectively.&lt;/strong&gt; Campaigns and lifecycle programs launch reliably, with clearer ownership, improved quality, and less manual effort.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer journeys become more intelligent.&lt;/strong&gt; Prospect and customer signals drive more relevant engagement, better handoffs, and improved progression across acquisition, activation, and expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI takes on meaningful operational work.&lt;/strong&gt; Agents and automation replace repetitive tasks, increase capacity, and allow teams to focus on higher-value activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth operations become more scalable.&lt;/strong&gt; Reusable capabilities replace one-off processes, reducing complexity and improving the economics of execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing and GTM leaders have a trusted partner.&lt;/strong&gt; Priorities are aligned, delivery is predictable, performance is visible, and new capabilities are developed against shared business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team operates as builders.&lt;/strong&gt; Technical and marketing expertise come together to continuously improve how Justworks engages prospects and customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The base wage range for this position based in our New York City Office is targeted at $166,000.00 - $214,000.00 per year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
