&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more information about Justworks’ Total Reward Philosophy, including all of the perks and benefits we are proud to offer our team members, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#total-reward-philosophy&quot;&gt;Total Rewards @ Justworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity At Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Justworks is committed to maintaining a workplace where diversity of identity, culture, and life experience is the norm and is celebrated authentically and respected consistently. Diversity in our work, our people, and our product drives creativity and innovation, entrepreneurial leadership and integrity, competitiveness, and collaboration throughout our business and in the market. We depend on our differences to make our team stronger, our workplace more dynamic, and our product accessible to all of our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer open to all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or familial status, disability, pregnancy, gender identity or expression, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status. Justworks is fully dedicated to providing necessary support to candidates with disabilities who may require reasonable accommodations. We also provide reasonable accommodations to employees based on their sincerely held religious beliefs, as well as for other covered reasons consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws. If you&#39;re in need of a reasonable accommodation, please reach out to us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@justworks.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your comfort and success matter to us, and we&#39;re here to ensure an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/press/company-news/justworks-impact-report-2024&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our DEIB Report&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Justworks is seeking a seasoned and strategic Senior People Business Partner with a strong record of developing and implementing people strategies and initiatives that meaningfully contribute to business results. As a Senior People Business Partner, you will be a trusted partner to your client group organizations, enabling leaders to build high-performing teams, and fostering an environment where Justworkers (employees) can grow, thrive and feel seen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a true HR guru. There is no problem too big or too small that you cannot tackle using your extensive knowledge and good judgement, making you an essential partner to the business and member of the People team. You skillfully balance the needs of the business with the experience of Justworkers, keeping our ambitious goals of helping small businesses grow with confidence top of mind. You’re curious and inquisitive, recognizing the need to gain relevant context and partner with the appropriate stakeholders to propose informed solutions to the&amp;nbsp; business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you thrive in fast-paced, matrixed environments and are energized by solving complex talent challenges at scale, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Success Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Business Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a strategic HR partner to client group leadership teams, understanding their business goals and connecting actionable People strategies to the success of the business, with a focus on scalable and sustainable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business leaders on workforce planning and organizational design, including evaluating the impact of emerging technologies and AI on future-ready team structures, job design, and skill requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach leaders through core talent decisions, including talent review, succession planning, change management, and leadership effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leveraging Data:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize data and metrics to identify trends, provide insights, and make recommendations to improve organizational effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change Leadership:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a champion of change in periods of transformation, developing and executing change management plans that enhance adoption, communication, and resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide and enable business leaders to confidently lead and navigate through organizational changes, ensuring smooth transitions and effective communication to Justworkers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity, Inclusion, and Belonging:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed DEIB principles into team-level strategies and act as an advocate for inclusive culture and equitable talent practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional talent initiatives, including leadership development, high-potential identification, and strategic capability building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive performance management and feedback culture by partnering with leaders to set clear and consistent expectations, calibrate talent, and embed accountability mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Team Partnership:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the People team Centers of Excellence (Talent Acquisition, Total Rewards, People Operations, Talent &amp;amp; Organizational Development, Diversity Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion, Workplace) to deliver programs that attract, engage, and retain top talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify, develop, and share best practices, tools, and insights with fellow People Business Partners to continuously elevate the team&#39;s capabilities and foster a culture of shared learning and expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and provide guidance on critical cross-functional people initiatives, collaborating with various departments to ensure alignment and successful execution of projects that impact the broader organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Relations:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support business leaders and Justworkers in addressing a wide range of complex employee relations matters, including performance concerns and policy violations, with expertise and empathy, in close partnership with the Employee Relations team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Administrative:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other related duties, including administrative tasks needed to ensure timely execution of People team-related responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Will Do Your Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior People Business Partner, &lt;em&gt;how&lt;/em&gt; results are achieved is paramount to your success. In this role, your foundational knowledge, skills, abilities and personal attributes are anchored in the following competencies:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative&lt;/strong&gt; - takes an approach that focuses on building relationships with others, understanding their problems, and developing solutions to challenges through open-ended questions and active listening.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution-oriented &lt;/strong&gt;- identifies the source of a question or challenge and provides the right, or a better, way of doing things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good judgement&lt;/strong&gt; - the exercise of critical thinking, analyzing and assessing problems and implications, identifying patterns, making connections of underlying issues, understanding risks and developing mitigation strategies, and taking ownership of the outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional expertise&lt;/strong&gt; - subject matter expertise of specific function(s), including knowledge of principles, practices, and domain knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communication &lt;/strong&gt;- the ability to articulate thoughts and express ideas effectively using oral, written, visual and non-verbal communication skills, as well as listening skills to gain understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability&lt;/strong&gt; - the ability to effectively flex communication and interpersonal styles to build rapport and influence stakeholders at all levels, from senior leadership to entry-level employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, all Justworkers focus on aligning their behaviors to our core values known as COGIS. It stands for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Camaraderie&lt;/strong&gt; - Day to day you can be seen working together toward a higher purpose. You like to have fun. You’re an active listener, treat people respectfully, and have a strong desire to know and help others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Openness&lt;/strong&gt; - Your default is to be open. You&#39;re willing to share information, understand other perspectives, and consider new possibilities. You’re curious, ask open questions, and are receptive to thoughts and feedback from others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grit &lt;/strong&gt;- You demonstrate grit by having the courage to commit and persevere. You’re committed, earnest, and dive in to get the job done well with a positive attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrity&lt;/strong&gt; - Simply put, do what you say and say what you&#39;ll do. You’re honest and forthright, have a strong moral compass, and strive to match your words with your actions while leading by example.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; - Be like Einstein: “Everything should be made as simple as possible, but no simpler.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in HR/HRBP, including demonstrated success directly partnering with and influencing executive-level leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience developing partnerships with business leaders, particularly in helping them lead an organization through significant change, and during a period of realignment and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated comfort leveraging AI and modern HR technologies to optimize HR processes, generate data-driven insights, and scale People operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success operating in a high-growth, rapidly evolving company with complex global distributed teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading talent strategy, org design, and cross-functional people initiatives in a matrixed organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to coach and communicate across all levels of the organization; up, down, and across&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and operational thinking with the ability to translate data into actionable insights, solve complex problems, and build scalable, strategic solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate confidential information with discretion and integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and conflict-resolution skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain knowledge and understanding of regulations, laws, and industry best practices to ensure compliance with all applicable international, federal, state, and local employment laws&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base wage range for this position based in our New York City Office is targeted at $147,000.00 - $190,000.00 per year.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Actual compensation is based on multiple factors that are unique to each candidate, including and not limited to skill set, level of relevant experience, and specific work location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Salary ranges for positions based in other locations may differ based on the cost of labor in that location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more information about Justworks’ Total Reward Philosophy, including all of the perks and benefits we are proud to offer our team members, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#total-reward-philosophy&quot;&gt;Total Rewards @ Justworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity At Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Justworks is committed to maintaining a workplace where diversity of identity, culture, and life experience is the norm and is celebrated authentically and respected consistently. Diversity in our work, our people, and our product drives creativity and innovation, entrepreneurial leadership and integrity, competitiveness, and collaboration throughout our business and in the market. We depend on our differences to make our team stronger, our workplace more dynamic, and our product accessible to all of our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer open to all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or familial status, disability, pregnancy, gender identity or expression, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status. Justworks is fully dedicated to providing necessary support to candidates with disabilities who may require reasonable accommodations. We also provide reasonable accommodations to employees based on their sincerely held religious beliefs, as well as for other covered reasons consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws. If you&#39;re in need of a reasonable accommodation, please reach out to us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@justworks.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your comfort and success matter to us, and we&#39;re here to ensure an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/press/company-news/justworks-impact-report-2024&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our DEIB Report&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re an experienced product designer with a passion for clarifying complexity by crafting seamless workflows and delightful product experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re confident working independently through the design process—from discovery through delivery—and adept at balancing user needs with business and technical constraints. You think beyond simple layouts, in terms of user journeys and workflows. You know when to rely on established design systems and when—and how—to extend those systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You communicate clearly, collaborate effectively across disciplines, and thrive as part of a cross-functional team. Your work is grounded in empathy for users, attention to detail, and a commitment to delivering practical outcomes that help users make informed choices.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Designer, you will define and deliver design solutions to business-critical efforts, creating seamless first impressions and long-term engagement paths for our small business customers and their employees. You will partner closely with peers in Product, Engineering, and Marketing to define strategic opportunities and bring coherent experiences to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Success Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver intuitive, polished user interfaces that that guide users through complex decisions and transitions, reduce friction, and build customer trust from first touch through ongoing engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with partners in Product, Engineering, and Marketing to define scope and align on user and business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in discovery efforts and leverage insights to frame design problems and translate them into actionable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pair with cross-functional partners to test, iterate, and launch impactful experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with peers in other design teams to extend and adapt design patterns and systems where necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help guide and support less-experienced designers contributing to shared efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other duties as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Will Do Your Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Designer, how results are achieved is as important as the results themselves. Success in this role is anchored in the following competencies:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Advocate for user needs and balance these with business constraints, grounding design in insights and data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Design across connected steps and decisions, rather than isolated features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver high-quality, polished work that aligns with the Justworks brand and design system guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with partners in Engineering, Product, Marketing, and Research to shape and deliver solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Use artifacts and storytelling to build shared understanding and guide team decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay grounded in user needs while flexing approaches to meet evolving context or constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, all Justworkers focus on aligning their behaviors to our core values known as COGIS. It stands for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Camaraderie&lt;/strong&gt; - Day to day you can be seen working together toward a higher purpose. You like to have fun. You’re an active listener, treat people respectfully, and have a strong desire to know and help others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Openness&lt;/strong&gt; - Your default is to be open. You&#39;re willing to share information, understand other perspectives, and consider new possibilities. You’re curious, ask open questions, and are receptive to thoughts and feedback from others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grit &lt;/strong&gt;- You demonstrate grit by having the courage to commit and persevere. You’re committed, earnest, and dive in to get the job done well with a positive attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrity&lt;/strong&gt; - Simply put, do what you say and say what you&#39;ll do. You’re honest and forthright, have a strong moral compass, and strive to match your words with your actions while leading by example.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; - Be like Einstein: “Everything should be made as simple as possible, but no simpler.”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prior Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in product design, ideally in B2B SaaS, HR tech, benefits, insurance, or related domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration experience working as part of a cross-functional team, collaborating fluidly with engineers, product managers, researchers, marketers, data scientists, and others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving initiatives from discovery through delivery across multiple product areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail, and a refined sense of craft in visual design, typography, and brand expression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Figma and AI prototyping tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To apply please share a portfolio of case studies demonstrating at minimum:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your role in the design of two shipped product experiences;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your design process, starting with the original business problem, your definition of the design problem, your explorations of potential solutions, and the resulting solution;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your collaboration with design and cross-functional peers, including any compromises that were required to realize the solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base wage range for this position based in our New York City Office is targeted at $166,000.00 to $214,000.00 per year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
