&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Justworks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Justworks is leveling the playing field for all small businesses. We handle the nitty-gritty of payroll, benefits, compliance, and HR, so our customers have more time to learn, grow, and seek something worthwhile. Today, Justworks offices in New York, Toronto, London, Tampa and Mexico City serve more than 12,000 businesses and 200,000 workers around the globe.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to help entrepreneurs and businesses grow with confidence. This means our customers are at the center of everything we do, and working at Justworks is an opportunity to obsess over creating and delivering value that helps millions achieve their dreams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re united by shared goals and motivations, best summed up in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;company values&lt;/a&gt;, which are reflected in our products and our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team / Product at Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Justworks Product team advances our mission by building products that extend levels of personal care and deep expertise that our customers have never experienced before. They craft innovative solutions that guide users through the most complicated challenges of running (and working for) a small business, with ease. They deeply understand complex regulatory spaces like FinTech, Healthcare, and HRTech, and have a keen intuition for how to connect threads across our customers’ needs and our business’ risk management and commercialization strategy. Our Product Managers lead highly collaborative creative endeavors, bringing together stakeholders across engineering, design, data services, operations, and customer-facing teams to deliver tangible value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining us, you’ll be part of an experienced team of Product Managers who have a proven track record of building large-scale software products that impact small businesses worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for teammates who will help shape Justworks’ future and make a profound impact on our business. As a Product Manager, you’ll be working across complex spaces - Fintech, Healthcare, HR Tech - all with serious policy/regulatory environments that will require you to have a keen intuition for customer needs, risk management, and commercialization. Care is at the center of everything we do, and you’ll need to love talking with customers and engaging with our Customer Success, Sales and Marketing teams to make sure that care is coming through in every part of our customers’ experience. You’ll be joining a diverse community of craftspeople who are passionate about learning, uphold exceptionally high standards of quality, and foster an environment of strategic thinking where product people can reach new heights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Tax team provides entrepreneurs the connective tissue with the government without the overhead of maintaining it all themselves. Billions of dollars reconciled across millions of paychecks and then paid to thousands of jurisdictions - &lt;em&gt;that &lt;/em&gt;is the incredible scale of taxes and we see our mission in three-folds:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accuracy &amp;amp; Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; To efficiently and accurately calculate, deposit, and file payroll taxes, and manage compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; To serve more small businesses and delight existing customers by streamlining tax setup, improving tax communications, and reducing confusion around complex regulatory requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; To empower our internal Tax Operations teams to have outsized impact by building tooling, reporting, and reconciliation capabilities that enable them to efficiently scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our job is to bring visibility and confidence in customer tax management across federal, state and local agencies but most importantly, free them from concern so they can focus on &lt;em&gt;their &lt;/em&gt;missions and make this world a better place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager on the Tax team&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll play a high-impact role by driving the roadmap of one or more pods focused on Tax. You will work closely with engineers that like to regularly achieve their sprint goals, exceed their story point capacity, and still have the ambition to delight our customers and be excited to come to work with you. You are welcome to try to beat them at geoguesser or other games we play when we finish refinement early – likelihood of winning is low but effort is rewarded with camaraderie which we live through team lunches and never letting you feel alone when a challenge arises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Equipped with this team, you’ll get to own business critical areas like tax calculation accuracy, filing operations, compliance workflows, and reconciliation tooling. You&#39;ll bring the ability to rally the team to solve complex problems with design, operations, engineering and compliance. They will in turn bolster your knowledge and capability to deliver. There will be a focus on scoping and prioritizing new initiatives with research-backed case development and work through the complete product development lifecycle to successful delivery. &lt;strong&gt;You don’t need to be an expert in compliance&lt;/strong&gt; but you do need to know how to ask great questions of your working partners and balance both product and platform compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a champion for your team&#39;s focus and productivity, you&#39;ll remove obstacles and develop team camaraderie to ensure maximum, high-quality output that aligns with Justworks&#39; business objectives. Though not yet actively teaching product management, you&#39;ll operate independently within your scope and clearly articulate the reasoning behind your decisions to your peers and cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace complex platform and experience related stakeholder problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with design to understand user pain points around tax filing, tax reporting, rate setup, and tax communications—especially in areas where regulatory language creates confusion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate expertise in deploying a product strategy and effectively tie insights to roadmap outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope, prioritize, and execute projects to deliver measurable business impact while ensuring clarity on objectives, leverage, and accountability for outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner deeply with Design and Engineering peers and organize and lead effective team processes and routines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own tax accuracy and compliance as product outcomes—understanding that errors have direct financial and regulatory impact on customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a rich understanding of engineering concepts, concerns and tradeoffs, and effectively communicate them to manage stakeholder expectations around deadlines and scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive camaraderie with your team while demonstrating effective collaboration with PMs across other pods/teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 5 years of product management experience in a modern technology business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and ability to influence your working partners without authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in leveraging generative AI to alleviate daily tasks and expedite delivery while retaining critical thinking and knowledge on core concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex, cross-team initiatives from ideation to execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of shipping continuous product improvements to an existing product portfolio at-scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills, capable of breaking down complex problems for team execution against business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep user empathy and a high bar for user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills for effectively conveying product-related matters, including changes in scope or strategic direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The base wage range for this position based in our New York City Office is targeted at $166,000 - $242,500 per year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Actual compensation is based on multiple factors that are unique to each candidate, including and not limited to skill set, level of relevant experience, and specific work location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Salary ranges for positions based in other locations may differ based on the cost of labor in that location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more information about Justworks’ Total Reward Philosophy, including all of the perks and benefits we are proud to offer our team members, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#total-reward-philosophy&quot;&gt;Total Rewards @ Justworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity At Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Justworks is committed to maintaining a workplace where diversity of identity, culture, and life experience is the norm and is celebrated authentically and respected consistently. Diversity in our work, our people, and our product drives creativity and innovation, entrepreneurial leadership and integrity, competitiveness, and collaboration throughout our business and in the market. We depend on our differences to make our team stronger, our workplace more dynamic, and our product accessible to all of our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer open to all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or familial status, disability, pregnancy, gender identity or expression, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status. Justworks is fully dedicated to providing necessary support to candidates with disabilities who may require reasonable accommodations. We also provide reasonable accommodations to employees based on their sincerely held religious beliefs, as well as for other covered reasons consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws. If you&#39;re in need of a reasonable accommodation, please reach out to us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@justworks.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your comfort and success matter to us, and we&#39;re here to ensure an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/press/company-news/justworks-impact-report-2024&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our DEIB Report&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product Marketing&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;defines how Justworks wins&lt;/strong&gt;—shaping our narrative, informing decisions, and driving growth through positioning, pricing, and go-to-market strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Platform Product Marketing team connects product strategy to market impact across the Justworks platform. We help customers understand the value of our products, bring new capabilities to market, and build the strategies and systems that support adoption and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to market products that help small businesses manage their teams and day-to-day operations, including time, attendance, and related workflows. You’ll lead positioning, go-to-market strategy, and adoption for a portfolio of connected products. Working closely with Product, Design, Engineering, Marketing, Revenue, and Customer Success, you’ll bring new capabilities to market and deliver measurable value for customers and the business. You combine customer insight, product judgment, and strong execution to make complex workflows easy to understand, influence product decisions with evidence, and lead cross-functional work from opportunity through launch and adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Success Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Positioning, Market Insight, and Narrative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strong understanding of customer needs, buyer expectations, market trends, and competitor strategies in the product areas you support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop positioning, messaging, and value propositions that clearly communicate our products’ benefits and differentiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect product stories to the broader Justworks platform narrative and tailor messaging to key audiences and use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop competitive narratives and practical enablement that help customer-facing teams position our products with confidence, address objections, and strengthen customer conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Strategy and Go-to-Market&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring customer, product, and market insights into product planning, prioritization, and roadmap decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Design to identify unmet needs and assess market opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop go-to-market strategies for new products and major features, including target audiences, positioning, channels, success measures, and launch sequencing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead launch readiness with Product, Marketing, Revenue, Customer Success, and other partner teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adoption and Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Growth, Lifecycle Marketing, Sales, Partnerships, and Customer Success to support awareness, conversion, adoption, and expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer feedback, product data, and frontline insights to improve onboarding and ongoing engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track success measures, using results to improve programs and inform future decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead high-impact initiatives from strategy through execution, creating clarity, accountability, and momentum across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence stakeholders across Product, Engineering, Design, Marketing, Revenue, and Customer Success without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring structure to ambiguous problems, make clear recommendations, and communicate tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen Product Marketing’s impact by leveraging and building reusable frameworks, tools, and processes that improve the quality and consistency of work across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All Justworkers align their behaviors to our core values known as COGIS:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Camaraderie:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate across teams to drive shared growth outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Openness:&lt;/strong&gt; Be transparent about strategy and tradeoffs; actively seek feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grit:&lt;/strong&gt; Persevere through ambiguity and the iterative work of building products and go-to-market systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrity:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure messaging is accurate and sets expectations that reinforce long-term trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate complex workforce and compliance needs into clear, actionable direction for customers and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-8 years of experience in product marketing, product strategy, growth, or a related B2B SaaS function, with a track record of bringing products to market and driving measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning positioning, messaging, go-to-market strategy, and adoption for complex products or multi-step customer workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer and market research skills, with the ability to synthesize qualitative and quantitative insights into clear product and go-to-market recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding storyteller who can translate operational, technical, and compliance-driven capabilities into compelling value for customers, prospects, executives, and customer-facing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence product strategy and roadmap decisions through customer insight, competitive intelligence, product data, and business context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading cross-functional initiatives and influencing stakeholders across Product, Engineering, Design, Revenue, Marketing, Customer Success, Compliance, and Operations without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and strategic thinking skills, with experience defining success metrics and evaluating launch performance, product adoption, customer engagement, and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in workforce management, HR technology, payroll, time and attendance, scheduling, compliance, fintech, or other SMB-focused software is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;The base wage range for this position based in our New York City Office is targeted at $166,000 - $214,000 per year.&lt;/p&gt;
