&lt;li&gt;Mastery of modern server side languages, Golang is a plus but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with cloud infrastructure management, preferably AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting and mentoring other engineers and acting as a “force multiplier”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with designers and product managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
